{"c":[{"name":"20261009T182045Z-7e784e62f684bf75","text":"Slice 2 replay: goal programs are re-run on recorded observations/choices (goals/replay.ts); a goal that observed never calls the writer again, so fresh() returns null for it. Observation values come from a frozen copy obs<n>:<windowId> kept in GoalRuns.sourcesOf.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261009T182045Z-9c9e184e59259bec","text":"Mail windows are conversations (one request reveals under half): mint each list cell at its own node (wholePart(nodePart(key,'label'))), or a subject several rows share charges every row and the rows get cut.","type":"note"}]}
